@startuml SD-06
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-06 / UC-06 - Confirm collection
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Staff as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Request collection details using a reservation reference
alt non-staff identity or unknown reference
system --> actor: Reject access or report not found; no changes
else authorised staff and existing reservation
system --> actor: Show owner, title, quantity, saved price, amount and\nstatus
actor -> system: Check reference, owner, title and quantity; confirm\ncollection
alt current status is Completed or Cancelled
system --> actor: Reject terminal-state action; no stock, status or total\nchange
else current status is Pending collection
note right of system
Set Completed. Keep quantity and saved price.
Do not deduct stock again; unlisting does not
block existing collection.
end note
alt save succeeds
system --> actor: Show Completed confirmation; record is eligible for\ncompleted totals
else save fails
system --> actor: Show error; status remains unchanged
end
end
end
note right of system
Payment and physical collection happen
outside BookBridge. This operation records
collection, not payment authorisation.
end note
@enduml
